Template not t miniLandscape w0012.png", "id": "8649301608477476", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982699_8649301621810808_7305192826088229005_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dgV8kz6olKEQ7kNvwEudD0D&_nc_oc=Adouz6T2P6_WFme2b882ObEB3BQWJIQfngj050NNh465VdN-jNW9xfsb9-WF5tkiVv8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC7ozXW6jsbFqJrXEszH4FPhIDTtQ-bl7Jtcyzmb3wGfw&oe=6A5E1E76"}, "display_name": "Landz and Seaz Mixed Reality", "keywords": ["Dinosaur", "mixed", "reality", "fish", "shark"], "long_description": "Create a Zoo and Ocean in your home with over 160 creatures\n- passthrough enabled to see animals in your actual surroundings in mixed reality / augmented reality , create a zoo or ocean aquarium in your home\n- handtracking enabled to allow hand placement of animals (controllers work as well)\n- animals are placeable and moveable with random spawn options and deletion options with bonus test levels with animal copying and enlarging options\n- 20 scenes of animals to enjoy with new bonus jungle area\n-- animals: 100+ ocean and 60+ land/air\n- animals include: dinosaurs, sharks, whales, zebras, bears, lions, tigers, lionfish, birds, sunfish, otter, penguin, moorish, leopards, cuttlefish,  elephants, rhinos, hippos, deer, cows, dolphins, clown fish, crocodiles,  starfish, turtles, mountain goats, dogs, cats, horses,  squid, discus, carp, trout, foxes, octopus, marlin,, tigers, zoo animals, common and exotic fish, and many more!", "short_description": "Create a Zoo and Ocean in your home with over 160 creatures!\n- passthrough enabled to see animals in your actual surroundings in mixed reality, create a zoo or ocean aquarium in your home\n- handtracking enabled to allow hand placement of animals (controllers work as well)\n- animals are placeable and moveable with random spawn/remove, bonus test levels to copy/enlarge\n- over 20 scenes of animals to enjoy\n-- animals:100+ ocean, 60+ land/air"}]}, "de